  textComponent: {fileID: 399066616}
  lines:
  - You see a Mandayangan surrounded by a bloodthirsty pack of Kapres
  - The Mandayangan sees you and gestures for you to run away...
  - but the Kapres take notice.
  - 'Mandayangan: Hey kid!! Come with me! We gotta get out of here!'
  - The gentle giant scoops you up and puts you on his shoulder before bolting for
    the ruins
  - 'Mandayangan: GET TO THE RUINS!!'
