--- !u!114 &722915654
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 722915649}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b45f09b7e9457344a81875d636b368e8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 1116795190}
  lines:
  - "*Steve and Manny pay the young farmer down the road a visit as per requested.
    They see that the young farmer\u2019s field is barren as well, same as the old
    farmer\u2019s field*"
  - 'Young Farmer Dwende: *Hums a glib tune*'
  - 'Steve: Good day, sir farmer!'
  - 'Young Dwende Farmer: Why, hello! Don''t you just love how my crops are looking?
    They''re so lush and grown!'
  - 'Manny: ...'
  - 'Steve: ...'
  - 'Steve: *Whispers* Hey, Manny... are you seeing what I''m seeing?'
  - "Manny: *Whispers* If what you\u2019re seeing is a whole lotta nothing, then
    yeah. This is not what I would call lush."
  - 'Steve: *Ahem* Ah, it''s looking really really good! The harvest is going to
    be really good I bet!'
  - 'Manny: Yeah! You seem really good at taking care of your crops! Your, uh, way
    of taking care of them must be to die for!'
  - "Steve: *Elbows Manny in the ear* In fact, we\u2019re so impressed that we were
    wondering exactly what it would take to be as good at farming as you are! Would
    you mind giving us some tips?"
  - 'Manny: *Rubs ear* RIGHT! We''re actually starting a new farm just up this road!'
  - 'Young Farmer Dwende: Glad that my efforts are being appreciated! It all just
    comes down to one miracle substance,'
  - 'Young Farmer Dwende: Powdered giant snake scales!'
  - 'Steve: Snake scales?'
  - 'Manny: GIANT snake scales?!'
  - 'Steve: *Shushes Manny* And did you just happen to randomly find these scales
    somewhere?'
  - 'Young Farmer Dwende: Pretty much. I heard rough, shaking trees from within the
    mountain forest while I was gathering logs.'
  - 'Young Farmer Dwende: When I went to check the disturbance out, I saw huge slither
    tracks, and so much giant snake scales!'
  - "Young Farmer Dwende: It must\u2019ve just finished shedding and left."
  - 'Steve: *Shushes Manny* And uh, do you suppose we could get a few of these powdered
    scales?'
  - 'Young Farmer Dwende: You know what, in the spirit of bayanihan, I''ll give you
    a bottle to start your new farm off! It''s just in the chest by that shed over
    there!'
  - 'Steve: Gee, thank you! I hope your crops grow even better!!'
  - 'Manny: *Whispers* Or hope they grow, period.'
  linesRepeat:
  - 'Young Farmer Dwende: *Hums a glib tune*'
  - 'Young Farmer Dwende: Oh, you two can just grab a bottle from that chest over
    by the shed! Go on, don''t be shy! I got more than enough of it from when I was
    last up in the mountains!'
  currentLines: []
  textInterval: 0.03
  pointer: {fileID: 1202008635}
  fertilizerMarker: {fileID: 1193454387}
  HUD: {fileID: 0}
