--- !u!114 &1416166854
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1416166852}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5abfeb0dde8d4d14a92c55b8d31e26c1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  playerStats: {fileID: 0}
  textComponent: {fileID: 1010201733}
  lines:
  - "*The elderly woman doesn\u2019t seem to notice them approach, and continue staring
    at the river*"
  - "Steve: Excuse me, ma\u2019am? What are you doing all alone in this cottage?"
  - "Elderly Woman: Ah, hello there, my dear. I must admit, I\u2019ve been a bit
    unsure on what I ought to be doing next. "
  - "Elderly Woman: I had decided to sit by the riverside last night, and take in
    the stillness of the moonless night. Unfortunately, I hadn\u2019t realized that
    a particularly cheeky crab had climbed its way up my chair and snipped apart
    the bracelet with the shiny rock I always kept close to me. "
  - "Elderly Woman: Please, my dear, might I trouble you to help me recover that
    bracelet of mine? It\u2019s very dear to me, almost as though it holds a piece
    of who I am.  "
  - "Steve: No worries ma\u2019am. We\u2019ll find it and be back before you even
    realize!"
  linesRepeat:
  - 'Steve: Huh. Where''s the elderly woman here earlier? '
  - 'Manny: I don''t see her. Why don''t you try knocking on the door?'
  - 'Steve: It doesn''t look like anyone''s home.'
  - '*Steve and Manny look through the windows* '
  - 'Manny: Whoa! Look at all the cobwebs... it doesn''t look like anyone''s lived
    here in a long time.'
  - "Steve: Then\u2026 who exactly was that elderly woman that we met\u2026?"
  - As you return, you notice the moon peeking just above the mountain peaks, leaving
    you with this moon-like rock bracelet.
  linesRepeat2:
  - 'Elderly Woman: The bracelet is very dear to me. It''s almost like... a piece
    of who I am. '
  currentLines: []
  textInterval: 0.03
  pointer: {fileID: 1732490106}
  clueImage: {fileID: 1443906156}
  HUD: {fileID: 0}
  endQuestMarker: {fileID: 396572577}
